    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a math problem at this point. like, if there is no ultimate goal or purpose, then the value of staying is exactly the same as the value of leaving. it's just a net zero. how can anyone say there's a reason to keep going if the math doesn't actually point anywhere?",
